  "interpretation": "<h3 data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"716\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"716\">Method:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"889\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"801\">\n<p data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"801\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"727\">FISH</strong> (Fluorescence In Situ Hybridization) using dual-color break-apart probe</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"889\">\n<p data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"889\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Detection of <strong data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"844\">ROS1 gene rearrangement</strong> in <strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"889\">non-small cell lung carcinoma (NSCLC)</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"937\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"937\">Clinical Use / Interpretation:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1208\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1064\">\n<p data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1064\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"963\">Positive / Detected</strong>: Suggests presence of <strong data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1006\">ROS1 gene fusion</strong>, may benefit from <strong data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1045\">targeted therapy</strong> (e.g., Crizotinib)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1136\">\n<p data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1136\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1094\">Negative / Not Detected</strong>: No actionable ROS1 rearrangement found</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1208\">\n<p data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1208\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Performed in <strong data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1176\">advanced NSCLC cases</strong> for therapeutic decision-making</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
